{"Title":"An Act relative to the cancellation of gym memberships","BillNumber":"H3562","DocketNumber":"HD2132","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"V_H1","Name":"Vanna Howard","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/V_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-11T11:14:28.48"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"V_H1","Name":"Vanna Howard","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/V_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-11T11:14:28.48"},{"Id":"MMD1","Name":"Michelle M. DuBois","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MMD1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-07T21:01:08.19"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3562/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Howard of Lowell, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3562) of Vanna Howard and Michelle M. DuBois relative to the cancellation of gym memberships.  Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure.","DocumentText":"\tSection 81 of chapter 93 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding the following paragraph:-\r\n\tAny seller of health club services whose website allows for the purchase or adjustment of a contract for health club services through the website including, but not limited to, purchasing additional services, programs and benefits or removing services, programs and benefits, shall provide a method of cancellation of such contracts on the seller’s website.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}